B.boz=new A.b0("Run Description",B.GJ,"Provide a detailed description of this run.\n\nInclude relevant details like what to expect, special instructions, what to bring, and any other important information for attendees.")
B.boA=new A.b0("Muted Text Colour",B.ps,"Colour for secondary / label text such as dates, locations, and other supporting copy (8-digit hex #RRGGBBAA recommended).\n\nLeave empty to use the theme default (#FFFFFF80 \u2014 50% white).")
B.boB=new A.b0("Secondary Button Colour",B.Gt,'Background colour for secondary action buttons \u2014 used infrequently for actions that are neither the main call-to-action nor a cancel/undo, such as "View all runs" or "Download GPX" (8-digit hex #RRGGBBAA recommended).\n\nLeave empty for no custom secondary button colour.')
